  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Boil the kettle.\n• Half-fill a medium saucepan with boiling water. Cook spaghetti in boiling water, over high heat, until ‘al dente’, 9 mins.\n• Reserve some pasta water (1/2 cup for 2P / 1 cup for 4P), then drain and return to pan. Drizzle with a little olive oil to prevent sticking.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/689c1fb11597ca633109a3b5/step-ebdfe100.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, finely chop garlic. Heat a drizzle of olive oil in a large frying pan over medium-high heat.\n• Cook sliced mushrooms until browned and softened, 6-8 mins.\n• Add tomato & herb seasoning and garlic and cook until fragrant, 1 min.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/689c1fb11597ca633109a3b5/step-b5762a10.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Stir in passata, the brown sugar, butter and the reserved pasta water and cook until slightly thickened, 2-3 mins.\n• Add cooked spaghetti and baby spinach, tossing until combined. Season to taste with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/689c1fb11597ca633109a3b5/step-1b894020.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide rich mushroom and tomato spaghetti between bowls.\n• Top with the chilli flakes (if using) to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/689c1fb11597ca633109a3b5/step-3493fa30.jpeg"
    }
  ]
